{"slug":"lolium-temulentum","plant":{"taxon":"Lolium temulentum","family":"Poaceae","rank":"species","gbif_key":2706242,"wikidata":"Q162088","iucn":null,"gbif_occurrences":15859,"common_name":"darnel","names":[{"source":"dioscorides","name":"αἶρα","monograph_id":"dsc:2.100","confidence":"high","note":"Aira growing among wheat = darnel; standard identification."},{"source":"culpeper","name":"Darnel","monograph_id":"cul:101-darnel","confidence":"high","note":"Standard identification."}],"n_compounds":28,"top_compounds":[{"name":"resveratrol","qid":"Q407329"},{"name":"Gibberellic acid","qid":"Q411138"},{"name":"Gibberellin A1","qid":"Q20972182"},{"name":"gibberellin A53","qid":"Q27103126"},{"name":"gibberellin A20","qid":"Q27103295"},{"name":"gibberellin A29","qid":"Q27103470"},{"name":"gibberellin A44","qid":"Q27103565"},{"name":"gibberellin A19","qid":"Q27103870"}],"epmc_total":123,"trials":0,"claims":[{"concept_id":"scaly_skin","dsc":1,"cul":1,"persistent":true,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.64,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"sciatica","dsc":1,"cul":1,"persistent":true,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.81,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","dsc":1,"cul":1,"persistent":true,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.84,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"dermatitis","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.57,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"diarrhea","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.54,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"infertility","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":1.19,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"kidney_disease","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.29,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"menorrhagia","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.94,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"scrofula","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.82,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.9,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"tinea","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":0,"lift":0.58,"evidence_tier":"unstudied"},{"concept_id":"wounds","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":7,"lift":4.91,"evidence_tier":"studied"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"dsc:2.100":{"ref":"De materia medica 2.100","headword":"αἶπα ἡ γινομένη","lang":"grc","source":"dioscorides","text":"αἶπα ἡ γινομένη ἐν τοῖς πυροῖς ἀλεσθεῖσα δύναμιν ἔχει περιχαρακτικὴν νομῶν καὶ σηπεδόνων καὶ γαγγραινῶν μετὰ ῥεφάνου φλοιοῦ καὶ ἀλῶν καταπλασσομένη, καὶ λειχῆνας ἀγρίους καὶ λέπρας σὺν θείῳ ἀπύρω καὶ ὄξει θεραπεύει. σὺν κόπρῳ δὲ περιστερᾶς καὶ λινοσπέρμῳ ἑψομένη ἐν οἴνῳ χοιράδας διαλύει καὶ τὰ δύσπεπτα ῥήττει, ἰσχιαδικούς τε σὺν μελικράτῳ ἑψηθεῖσα καὶ καταπλασσομένη ὠφελεῖ. σὺν ἀλφίτῳ δʼ ἢ σμύρνη ἢ κρόκῳ ἢ λιβανωτῷ ὑποθυμιωμένη συνεργεῖ ταῖς συλλήμψεσιν.","spans":[{"start":69,"end":74,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":79,"end":86,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":93,"end":101,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":153,"end":159,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":174,"end":178,"concept_id":"scaly_skin","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":271,"end":277,"concept_id":"scrofula","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":312,"end":318,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":446,"end":453,"concept_id":"infertility","polarity":"therapeutic"}]},"cul:101-darnel":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Darnel","headword":"Darnel","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"It is a malicious part of sullen Saturn. As it is not without some vices, so hath it also many virtues. The meal of Darnel is very good to stay gangrenes, and other such like fretting and eating cankers, and putrid sores: It also cleanses the skin of all leprosies, morphews, ringworms, and the like, if it be used with salt and raddish roots. And being used with quick brimstone and vinegar, it dissolves knots and kernels, and breaks those that are hard to be dissolved, being boiled in wine with pigeon’s dung and Linseed: A decoction thereof made with water and honey, and the places bathed therewith, is profitable for the sciatica. Darnel meal applied in a poultice draws forth splinters and broken bones in the flesh: The red Darnel, boiled in red wine and taken, stays the lask and all other fluxes, and women’s bloody issues; and restrains urine that passes away too suddenly.","spans":[{"start":144,"end":153,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":195,"end":202,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":215,"end":220,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":230,"end":247,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":255,"end":264,"concept_id":"scaly_skin","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":266,"end":274,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":276,"end":285,"concept_id":"tinea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":628,"end":636,"concept_id":"sciatica","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":672,"end":693,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":781,"end":785,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":812,"end":833,"concept_id":"menorrhagia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":849,"end":884,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":[]}